  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.3.0\n\t\t\tAdded support for .NET 10\n\t\t\tFixed an isse preventing to disable the automatic plugin initialization on iOS\n\t\t\tMinor improvements\n            Version 2.2.0\n            Updated native iOS bindings to version 12.12 to fix crashes on iOS\n            Fixed an issue with Rewarded Interstitial on iOS  that was preventing to receive the UserEarnedReward event\n\t\t\tVersion 2.1.0\t\t\n\t\t\tRenamed MauiMTAdmob to MauiMtAdmob (BREAKING CHANGE)\n\t\t\tAdded support for Native Ads on iOS\n\t\t\tAdded ATTrackingManager request (licensed version) - Remember to add <key>NSUserTrackingUsageDescription</key> to your Info.plist\n\t\t\tUpdated to support new version of MTAdmob.iOS.Binding (12.9.0)\n\t\t\tUpdated to support new version of MTAdmob.UMP.iOS.Binding (3.0.0)\n\t\t\tAdded support for new version of Xamarin.GooglePlayServices.Ads.Lite (124.0.0.3)\n\t\t\tAdded support for new version of Xamarin.Google.UserMessagingPlatform (3.2.0.3)\n\t\t\tRemoved support for .Net8\n\t\t\tVersion 2.0.3\n\t\t\tAdded support for Interstitial Immersive mode on Android\n\t\t\tAdded PrivacyOptionStatus\n\t\t\tImproved Privacy option form logic\n\t\t\tAdded support for new version of Xamarin.GooglePlayServices.Ads.Lite (124.0.0.2)\n\t\t\tAdded support for new version of Xamarin.Google.UserMessagingPlatform (3.2.0.2)",
  "repository": "",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": true,
